hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:JobId rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:JobResponse a owl:Class .
hpc:hasContent a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobResponse ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Content .
hpc:Content a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Class ;
        owl:unionOf (hpc:JsonContent hpc:YamlContent) ] .
hpc:JsonContent a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Class ;
        owl:intersectionOf (hpc:Schema hpc:JsonRequest) ] .
hpc:YamlContent a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Class ;
        owl:intersectionOf (hpc:Schema hpc:Yaml) ] .
hpc:Schema a owl:Class .
```

This ontology fragment represents the classes `Job`, `JobResponse`, `Content`, `JsonContent`, and `YamlContent`. It also defines the properties `JobId`, `hasContent`, and `Schema`. The `Content` class is a union of `JsonContent` and `YamlContent`, and both `JsonContent` and `YamlContent` are intersections of the `Schema` class and either `JsonRequest` or `Yaml`.
